"轨迹读取历史快照，每个完整 ISO 周取最后有效交易日。初始化历史使用回填时可得的复权价，可能与当时发布值略有差异。此图不使用 JdK RRG 专有计算。" = "Trails read saved snapshots at the last valid session of each completed ISO week. Initial backfills use adjusted prices available at backfill time and may differ slightly from original observations. This chart does not use proprietary JdK RRG calculations.";
