"先计算 ETF 与 SPY 复权价的对数差，再作 5 日均值。横轴取第 63 至第 21 个交易日前的变化，纵轴取最近 21 个交易日的变化；两者不重叠。分别以当日中位数和 MAD 标准化，再用 tanh 软压缩。" = "Log ratios of adjusted ETF prices to SPY are averaged over 5 sessions. The horizontal axis measures change from 63 to 21 sessions ago; the vertical axis measures the latest 21 sessions. These windows do not overlap. Each axis uses daily median/MAD normalisation and tanh compression.";
