"按当前持仓的股数回推每天的市值，从这段时间里的最高点算回落。组合回落多少，正好等于每只持仓从那天高点以来的涨跌之和，所以每一层就是这只持仓拖了多少。拖累最大的几只各占一层（直到下一只不到全部拖累的 6%，最多 6 只）；有持仓上涨时会抵消一部分，组合的线会高于色块。轻点任意持仓，看它自己的水下曲线。" = "Each day's value is today's share counts at that day's close, measured from the highest point in this period. The portfolio's fall equals the sum of every holding's change since that high, so each layer is exactly how much that holding pulled. The biggest pulls get a layer each, until the next is under 6% of the total pull, up to six. Holdings that rose offset part of it, so the portfolio's line can sit above the layers. Tap any holding to see its own underwater curve.";
